This is the CrownOS Neovim configuration.

It is a modified version of AstroNvim and its astrocore, astroui and astrolsp
libraries (https://github.com/AstroNvim), copyright the AstroNvim
contributors, renamed and adapted for CrownOS in 2026. Colors come from the
`crownos` colorscheme that crownos-theme-engine writes to colors/crownos.lua.

